\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Saviour, like a Shepherd lead us;
\par Much we need Thy tender care;
\par In Thy pleasant pastures feed us,
\par For our use Thy folds prepare:
\par Blessed Jesus,
\par Thou hast bought us, Thine we are.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We are Thine, do Thou befriend us;
\par Be the guardian of our way;
\par Keep Thy flock, from sin defend us,
\par Seek us when we go astray:
\par Blessed Jesus,
\par Hear us when we praise and pray.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou hast promised to receive us,
\par Poor and sinful though we be;
\par Thou have mercy to relieve us,
\par Grace to cleanse, and make us free;
\par Blessed Jesus,
\par Early let us turn to Thee.
\par 
\par 4.
\par Early let us seek Thy favour;
\par Early let us do Thy will;
\par Gracious Lord, our only Saviour,
\par With Thyself our bossoms fill;
\par Blessed Jesus,
\par Thou hast loved us-love us still.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

